[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2605304777","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101734#issuecomment-2605304777","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101734","id":2605304777,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bScvJ","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-21T17:12:31Z","updated_at":"2025-01-21T17:12:31Z","body":"The reproduction steps seem incomplete. You are missing the `mono_prefix` argument, so you may not be building Godot properly. Make sure to follow the instructions for [compiling Godot with Mono](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/3.6/development/compiling/compiling_with_mono.html) from the 3.6 documentation.\n\nIn Godot 3, web exports require you to build the Mono runtime. See the [_Building the Mono runtime_](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/3.6/development/compiling/compiling_with_mono.html#building-the-mono-runtime), [_Targeting WebAssembly_](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/3.6/development/compiling/compiling_with_mono.html#targeting-webassembly), and [_Base Class Library_](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/3.6/development/compiling/compiling_with_mono.html#base-class-library) sections in the documentation page linked above.\n\nSpecifically, the error you are getting is because Godot is unable to find the file `mscorlib.dll` in either of these paths:\n- `<templates>/bcl/javascript`\n- `<templates>/bcl/wasm`.\n\nYou may be interested in using the scripts in the [`godot-mono-builds`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-mono-builds/tree/master) repository to build the Mono runtime, as recommended in the documentation.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2605304777/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5817471975","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101734#issuecomment-5817471975","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101734","id":5817471975,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWr-T5w","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.g